    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Contrato",
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**SLI** (lo medido, ventana del dashboard): disponibilidad = `status < 500` / total; latencia = `latency_ms` ≤ umbral / total; p95.\n\n**SLO** (meta interna): **${slo_availability}%** disponibles y **${slo_latency_pct}%** de requests ≤ **${slo_latency_ms} ms**.\n\n**SLA** (compromiso, más holgado): **${sla_availability}%** disponibles y **${sla_latency_pct}%** ≤ **${sla_latency_ms} ms**.\n\nFuente: Loki `{job=\"backend\"}` access log JSON. `/health` no se loguea. El error budget llega a 0 cuando los errores del período consumen el margen `100 − objetivo`."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "SLI disponibilidad",
      "description": "Fracción de requests con status < 500 en el rango.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 5 },
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "decimals": 3,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 0.995 },
              { "color": "green", "value": 0.999 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "textMode": "value"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time({job=\"backend\"} | json | event=\"request\" | status < 500 [$__range])) / sum(count_over_time({job=\"backend\"} | json | event=\"request\" [$__range]))",
          "queryType": "instant",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
